  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "For a considerable period, I found myself meandering through the tranquil streets of the intriguing town of Besançon, which is nestled like a peninsula encircled by a river in the shape of a horseshoe.",
      "output_sha256": "ce2b27179c14266c40834959e5e355ad99942b0b05c0cf91c0befbed45be6a58",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": 0.45813,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ce1902b93405d304a7c845f48106a7ab67fd2c2f8c6174666b3cee8974db20ae"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ce2b27179c14266c40834959e5e355ad99942b0b05c0cf91c0befbed45be6a58",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "You may learn from the guide books that it was the birthplace of Victor Hugo, and that it is a military station with many forts, near the French frontier.",
      "output_sha256": "a58be1d75d6e483106a992e74bf4eb3af78e20bf731926942d9da4f51e54ac6b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "a58be1d75d6e483106a992e74bf4eb3af78e20bf731926942d9da4f51e54ac6b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But you will not learn from guide books that the very tiles on the roofs seem to be of some quainter and more delicate colour than the tiles of all the other towns of the world; that the tiles look like the little clouds of some strange sunset, or like the lustrous scales of some strange fish.",
      "output_sha256": "5b349d4c05a86d185758c0cde2fef868b57e58f28d13c0d21035b83fce20b97f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "5b349d4c05a86d185758c0cde2fef868b57e58f28d13c0d21035b83fce20b97f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The allure of Besançon lies in its ability to captivate the eye at every turn, whether it's a meticulously carved face peering out from a street corner, a glimpse of verdant fields through a weathered archway, or an unexpected splash of color adorning a spire or dome.",
      "output_sha256": "8d639328191bf0c5dc5004a1a21bf07ad0879d5c96d9cc4599ec9135a07a9231",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": 0.428858,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        4,
        5
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "83fa5138a5e5dbe3f06bdb4b747675fa847f6651d6d6f94b83c548936da3ec53",
        "f85d30e7d95a052f65167f1f1095186d1190c91502b4ab7aedab460a6eab8870"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8d639328191bf0c5dc5004a1a21bf07ad0879d5c96d9cc4599ec9135a07a9231",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Evening was coming on and in the light of it all these colours so simple and yet so subtle seemed more and more to fit together and make a fairy tale.",
      "output_sha256": "d56b799494bf7cf06b47a450275ff4c05f3a65bd6e71ef55f2410e48a31ec580",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "d56b799494bf7cf06b47a450275ff4c05f3a65bd6e71ef55f2410e48a31ec580",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I sat down for a little outside a café with a row of little toy trees in front of it, and presently the driver of a fly (as we should call it) came to the same place.",
      "output_sha256": "74ec5821a1931ff38f697c82dbe96eeb530a6ea640f25f4a4a5d4fa08a95bb6a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "74ec5821a1931ff38f697c82dbe96eeb530a6ea640f25f4a4a5d4fa08a95bb6a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "He was one of those very large and dark Frenchmen, a type not common but yet typical of France; the Rabelaisian Frenchman, huge, swarthy, purple-faced, a walking wine-barrel; he was a sort of Southern Falstaff, if one can imagine Falstaff anything but English.",
      "output_sha256": "5ccd671ce5ace1c0983bd939f9db3962c62a2d3d1c329a0e1721ae8934342d94",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "5ccd671ce5ace1c0983bd939f9db3962c62a2d3d1c329a0e1721ae8934342d94",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And, indeed, there was a vital difference, typical of two nations.",
      "output_sha256": "2a1ef406b6af363c37fd4de6d4a14638a120646be0d8885cc4cbd00269015a19",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_human_sha256": "2a1ef406b6af363c37fd4de6d4a14638a120646be0d8885cc4cbd00269015a19",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "For while Falstaff would have been shaking with hilarity like a huge jelly, full of the broad farce of the London streets, this Frenchman was rather solemn and dignified than otherwise—as if pleasure were a kind of pagan religion.",
      "output_sha256": "1333c8400a82d74ad2314a362e594f5c07e003973f187b97e67bb9b5171df71a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "1333c8400a82d74ad2314a362e594f5c07e003973f187b97e67bb9b5171df71a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "After some talk which was full of the admirable civility and equality of French civilisation, he suggested without either eagerness or embarrassment that he should take me in his fly for an hour’s ride in the hills beyond the town.",
      "output_sha256": "64295411b982679aee9e2fd7d5b27bb833fe1cdb61373eead93c802b1d422703",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "64295411b982679aee9e2fd7d5b27bb833fe1cdb61373eead93c802b1d422703",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Despite the encroaching darkness, I readily agreed, drawn by the allure of a long, winding road that beckoned me like a silken thread.",
      "output_sha256": "878366a6f200e398ff8557867955a48ea0d796f516910432985e37736e6671c4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": 0.306817,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        12
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0adedeab756dbc32062b380a84da5e372463ef97d73815d63b3ea90d88862c78"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_ai_sha256": "878366a6f200e398ff8557867955a48ea0d796f516910432985e37736e6671c4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "We drove through the strong, squat gateway that was made by Romans, and I remember the coincidence like a sort of omen that as we passed out of the city I heard simultaneously the three sounds which are the trinity of France.",
      "output_sha256": "3448eae654182890432fd03ecef6cda5f13f93b9623e2063d398eedd98dac070",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "3448eae654182890432fd03ecef6cda5f13f93b9623e2063d398eedd98dac070",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "These sounds create what a poet once described as a “tangled trinity,” a concept I have no intention of unraveling.",
      "output_sha256": "5a2b8e54aca66fd80de2b41d07d0554a2d99303322831bdf33f4167a45afefb1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": 0.379104,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7a420539c0e427e6e491c93edc665bf48152c75cc0dfbffe8087b2778f6075ae"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5a2b8e54aca66fd80de2b41d07d0554a2d99303322831bdf33f4167a45afefb1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "What those three elements signify, how they coexist, and whether they can somehow be harmonized is a mystery that eludes me.",
      "output_sha256": "c05bb18e4380b306f6d06783370412c6048077846621c3a237ab27aa6dd5ecd1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": 0.313169,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c4be0848437ac0cd5a676071c3519b0751248c3d4f0ae81602f69e2cda3259df"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c05bb18e4380b306f6d06783370412c6048077846621c3a237ab27aa6dd5ecd1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "For the brass band in the Casino gardens behind me was playing with a sort of passionate levity some ramping tune from a Parisian comic opera, and while this was going on I heard also the bugles on the hills above, that told of terrible loyalties and men always arming in the gate of France; and I heard also, fainter than these sounds and through them all, the Angelus.",
      "output_sha256": "e098780605d03ee0aa24bc6b9f06d8525124fb204174d5377544cc0cb9be0544",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "e098780605d03ee0aa24bc6b9f06d8525124fb204174d5377544cc0cb9be0544",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": ".....",
      "output_sha256": "f85d30e7d95a052f65167f1f1095186d1190c91502b4ab7aedab460a6eab8870",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "f85d30e7d95a052f65167f1f1095186d1190c91502b4ab7aedab460a6eab8870",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "This convergence of symbols instilled within me a distinct sensation that I had left not only France but perhaps even the civilized world itself.",
      "output_sha256": "bb3b63bfb35a6e069ff37428e2628f10ae89b1e12867cf6ef46f1689516a7434",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": 0.500932,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        18
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "de646c89289faa6fdeeea72983c98e50c36a8943827ce779b34cd36b13035b64"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_ai_sha256": "bb3b63bfb35a6e069ff37428e2628f10ae89b1e12867cf6ef46f1689516a7434",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The landscape around me was wild enough to support such a notion.",
      "output_sha256": "d6536f2cd53fc5f8a7c0c4cd0a092c870d3b72b275c5530ad2c79f043e91ac76",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": 0.502424,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0c407cd3f51127ea20d80d381a95e6193c2e4bcacd932a14dc3bc11927fdb91d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d6536f2cd53fc5f8a7c0c4cd0a092c870d3b72b275c5530ad2c79f043e91ac76",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I have seen perhaps higher mountains, but I have never seen higher rocks; I have never seen height so near, so abrupt and sensational, splinters of rock that stood up like the spires of churches, cliffs that fell sudden and straight as Satan fell from heaven.",
      "output_sha256": "467a9b63499142051fb5bfb0726898622b5728ce97c66fce0834c49f25cbac2d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "467a9b63499142051fb5bfb0726898622b5728ce97c66fce0834c49f25cbac2d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "There was also a quality in the ride which was not only astonishing, but rather bewildering; a quality which many must have noticed if they have driven or ridden rapidly up mountain roads.",
      "output_sha256": "e9a5826c5a615cb368035171e058e1c0926d5dc7130b05c68e490363c68bf394",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "e9a5826c5a615cb368035171e058e1c0926d5dc7130b05c68e490363c68bf394",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I mean a sense of gigantic gyration, as of the whole earth turning about one’s head.",
      "output_sha256": "5c7d2ae97c42e7c64d5c00b16c419a30762469df953c91cea01d75d359d6c651",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "5c7d2ae97c42e7c64d5c00b16c419a30762469df953c91cea01d75d359d6c651",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It is quite inadequate to say that the hills rose and fell like enormous waves.",
      "output_sha256": "3d3ca1a182aa232b89f56efa6c8a2415c484ade03d2eff8e07b30b3cdfc6a3fc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "3d3ca1a182aa232b89f56efa6c8a2415c484ade03d2eff8e07b30b3cdfc6a3fc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Rather the hills seemed to turn about me like the enormous sails of a windmill, a vast wheel of monstrous archangelic wings.",
      "output_sha256": "c182e5d7b77f8718dc2cc2365bebee525ed8ed2b3fb87c3779edb9c9e452d0a9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "c182e5d7b77f8718dc2cc2365bebee525ed8ed2b3fb87c3779edb9c9e452d0a9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "As we drove on and up into the gathering purple of the sunset this dizziness increased, confounding things above with things below.",
      "output_sha256": "197839dc9c5ae8ac73937edaf74bfbe4f81feaca3412a0ac175376782ebd8c9b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "197839dc9c5ae8ac73937edaf74bfbe4f81feaca3412a0ac175376782ebd8c9b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Towering walls of wooded rock loomed above me, giving the impression of a great, protective canopy.",
      "output_sha256": "194e9d7d880d92bd5ffbcb75ca2ac47d340b07b3ac024a6bcfa8f5f6faa4310a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": 0.419295,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "166a9c1ac270875be8979c756656f5f7363a4539758bbb1f4cd356401d7dcef4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_ai_sha256": "194e9d7d880d92bd5ffbcb75ca2ac47d340b07b3ac024a6bcfa8f5f6faa4310a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I stared at them until I fancied that I was staring down at a wooded plain.",
      "output_sha256": "e5e3f8cb6a368016356981e2fbca0b80720da17f2991889721d41d1d56791e69",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "e5e3f8cb6a368016356981e2fbca0b80720da17f2991889721d41d1d56791e69",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Below me steeps of green swept down to the river.",
      "output_sha256": "71b143e1fe32d3d56810e509f0f636df3205bcca653f46e093b7f598b8124b4f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "71b143e1fe32d3d56810e509f0f636df3205bcca653f46e093b7f598b8124b4f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I stared at them until I fancied that they swept up to the sky.",
      "output_sha256": "4e2f7f6086a76c6d3c1bf62ee8cf0e6dfad53f00baf791bdf2b9978fd2074a65",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "4e2f7f6086a76c6d3c1bf62ee8cf0e6dfad53f00baf791bdf2b9978fd2074a65",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The purple darkened, night drew nearer; it seemed only to cut clearer the chasms and draw higher the spires of that nightmare landscape.",
      "output_sha256": "b84bf7229fe067067121ec60cfb4e6e8b08432016e9637c1b24920c4ad523e29",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "b84bf7229fe067067121ec60cfb4e6e8b08432016e9637c1b24920c4ad523e29",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Above me, the imposing figure of the driver loomed, his broad back shrouded in mystery, reminiscent of the enigmatic presence of Death in Watts' painting.",
      "output_sha256": "5fd8d4105ef94eb94334105e831ac9c8a2bed776bbdd72c7323c8739ddb8640a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": 0.537565,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "fea42e856242e45c5be2771cf2ea514d7e2de9dc562bc3235d39b8b1b26fa9a4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5fd8d4105ef94eb94334105e831ac9c8a2bed776bbdd72c7323c8739ddb8640a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Feeling increasingly fanciful, I sought to ground myself in ordinary conversation.",
      "output_sha256": "963f3ec148515fb4ed3752bec5f30be579cfd0576ac191cd41dcaf80b07afd6c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": 0.31369,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1a3f9b615cd05b362b8eb152296e2f201261a1a8a9d9be485f8c6d94eb0b2983"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_ai_sha256": "963f3ec148515fb4ed3752bec5f30be579cfd0576ac191cd41dcaf80b07afd6c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I called out to the driver in French, “Where are you taking me?” and it is a literal and solemn fact that he answered me in the same language without turning around, “To the end of the world.”",
      "output_sha256": "55bbe358ca5326b959ff4d298fe40864d0aa9a9861044b768ffefd56dd0337c4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "55bbe358ca5326b959ff4d298fe40864d0aa9a9861044b768ffefd56dd0337c4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I did not answer.",
      "output_sha256": "5f33a8b3a86aa3d9276fd660b64c951427b1d16c106bd18d4bb36c8a09ffd7dd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "5f33a8b3a86aa3d9276fd660b64c951427b1d16c106bd18d4bb36c8a09ffd7dd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I let him drag the vehicle up dark, steep ways, until I saw lights under a low roof of little trees and two children, one oddly beautiful, playing at ball.",
      "output_sha256": "46b2b714e5bd478f854792ebc1ae127621fb2a4d679ab48262c4cc74631591d1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "46b2b714e5bd478f854792ebc1ae127621fb2a4d679ab48262c4cc74631591d1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Soon, we emerged onto the main street of a quaint hamlet, where the words LE BOUT DU MONDE—French for \"the end of the world\"—were boldly inscribed on the wall of a local inn.",
      "output_sha256": "b3c3f0a96a20fe664963e4a0885fac7797fe10950ae2f7bbe6faec9dfcc26917",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": 0.550268,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5f74e5f2b17c9a7d790c59fbca63eb672df359eb58765a6910dc89bd25ea036c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b3c3f0a96a20fe664963e4a0885fac7797fe10950ae2f7bbe6faec9dfcc26917",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        35
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The driver and I sat down outside that inn without a word, as if all ceremonies were natural and understood in that ultimate place.",
      "output_sha256": "bd0a156e06f8c5a75d4ba4261ccd239062f533ea7501e5265b952f3f29841059",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "bd0a156e06f8c5a75d4ba4261ccd239062f533ea7501e5265b952f3f29841059",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I ordered bread for both of us, and red wine, that was good but had no name.",
      "output_sha256": "8698de76c7d3aff4ff173fc74c21599294dc0f25332d00047bfc732460e7f7a1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "8698de76c7d3aff4ff173fc74c21599294dc0f25332d00047bfc732460e7f7a1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "On the other side of the road was a little plain church with a cross on top of it and a cock on top of the cross.",
      "output_sha256": "1ec6c904e037e774738cdce13f5766bc4d102fc0576a10715d0b8bb558d905b5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "1ec6c904e037e774738cdce13f5766bc4d102fc0576a10715d0b8bb558d905b5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "To me, this represented a fitting conclusion to the world; if the tale of existence were to end here, it would do so on a note of beauty.",
      "output_sha256": "e7ad8f79c558f043ab986eebbc2d177ecf9a903d4464db903fb0131b48118741",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": 0.387143,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        40
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "9e709dffda3a980c227e3b43c37524f6b5a48bfa29faff03fac75139e2fe8061"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e7ad8f79c558f043ab986eebbc2d177ecf9a903d4464db903fb0131b48118741",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I mused over whether I could truly find contentment in this place, where the best elements of Christendom converged—a church, children at play, fertile land, and a tavern where men could engage in conversation.",
      "output_sha256": "e42055925d40d6f5e57f47afcf7bbf08f6eb18fcdf93d914ef165e5ed396067d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": 0.423263,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "959cc73784b74eea8498bc3d42397df7e8ca39804ee788b7a2f86274a2f03063"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e42055925d40d6f5e57f47afcf7bbf08f6eb18fcdf93d914ef165e5ed396067d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "However, amid these thoughts, an unusual doubt and desire began to swell within me, prompting me to rise abruptly.",
      "output_sha256": "8516a835b6d22411270bf48565e9be5a50e2d41ed13241e9dea70a6fda068927",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": 0.324737,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        42
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f1ee8a53c85f86269c76a848c83543e0bbbe83a98f0a790ddfe740e661d0409c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8516a835b6d22411270bf48565e9be5a50e2d41ed13241e9dea70a6fda068927",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“Are you not satisfied?” asked my companion.",
      "output_sha256": "44c0399ab4bf359dc61a42d29f978e1da1d7a6afbf42ea1489db764211eabae7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_human_sha256": "44c0399ab4bf359dc61a42d29f978e1da1d7a6afbf42ea1489db764211eabae7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“No,” I replied, “I am not satisfied, even at the end of the world.”",
      "output_sha256": "ac260bc46640e66a5ed989103ea6281709777aa0d202f73c409fac5e57880211",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": 0.892857,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "49487328e7881dd2c0677b12aa3947159a75cbd66f5c95e913dad8349d991123"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ac260bc46640e66a5ed989103ea6281709777aa0d202f73c409fac5e57880211",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Then, after a silence, I said, “Because you see there are two ends of the world.",
      "output_sha256": "f6e4bbce43b25290726000e3f229dda0f9bac3e2c742c40eaedbb0fe3b1dd2c5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_human_sha256": "f6e4bbce43b25290726000e3f229dda0f9bac3e2c742c40eaedbb0fe3b1dd2c5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And this is the wrong end of the world; at least the wrong one for me.",
      "output_sha256": "aff7ab6bd9a763707f5a2b3d0497d7bae550b275914f805406c4731579596d1d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_human_sha256": "aff7ab6bd9a763707f5a2b3d0497d7bae550b275914f805406c4731579596d1d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "This is the French end of the world.",
      "output_sha256": "974a66086c686cc59be59ea2dd5a8657d0dfa989ef7282c65c889f035193bd76",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_human_sha256": "974a66086c686cc59be59ea2dd5a8657d0dfa989ef7282c65c889f035193bd76",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I want the other end of the world.",
      "output_sha256": "05d5dd666f3dafe1f2d5b22e3ed7aad0150a3b61945d15c7c6e4b1cba6649738",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_human_sha256": "05d5dd666f3dafe1f2d5b22e3ed7aad0150a3b61945d15c7c6e4b1cba6649738",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Drive me to the other end of the world.”",
      "output_sha256": "50ac1a3ef627e0cc428d2339b8d71aa8466d3affde675f2e7a4cecefb8cc599e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_human_sha256": "50ac1a3ef627e0cc428d2339b8d71aa8466d3affde675f2e7a4cecefb8cc599e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“The other end of the world?” he queried.",
      "output_sha256": "3a18fd32a876acc2a381edd544411d1e8542f688c8a7c39e6e719900800ea086",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": 0.82375,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        50
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e604d0b1b1e7f7dd9989df45b8c5c2bff33097302f38bd2e504427a969409180"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_ai_sha256": "3a18fd32a876acc2a381edd544411d1e8542f688c8a7c39e6e719900800ea086",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        49
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“Where is that?”",
      "output_sha256": "bbacc6c00ebdecf09fff273ac6495678cab6ab9cb99c64528418a735bf2ffaea",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_human_sha256": "bbacc6c00ebdecf09fff273ac6495678cab6ab9cb99c64528418a735bf2ffaea",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“It is in Walham Green,” I whispered, my voice hoarse with urgency.",
      "output_sha256": "c04742918945ad9dc2d735c0bdf5373daedfcd7589c37a3fabf0c7749c1c8d21",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": 0.626905,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        52
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "dc791a51dc11091a3ecba04afe9bf02ca1249732cc68c14590567e3f8a4efedd"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c04742918945ad9dc2d735c0bdf5373daedfcd7589c37a3fabf0c7749c1c8d21",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        51
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“You see it on the London omnibuses.",
      "output_sha256": "7bb3c2d43eb7ec966af3d353bd67e45f5a694a0b6424c11e6e8853c242900d67",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 53,
      "source_human_sha256": "7bb3c2d43eb7ec966af3d353bd67e45f5a694a0b6424c11e6e8853c242900d67",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "‘World’s End and Walham Green.’",
      "output_sha256": "379495a4f902f6cc085574962953397edc68fa8ca67f6ce8095d48ddbb281e70",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 54,
      "source_human_sha256": "379495a4f902f6cc085574962953397edc68fa8ca67f6ce8095d48ddbb281e70",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Oh, I know how good this is; I love your vineyards and your free peasantry, but I want the English end of the world.",
      "output_sha256": "75a8c7f09857e6e9364e3163550bd3610ac4336452c3bd04130233b63331ab9b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 55,
      "source_human_sha256": "75a8c7f09857e6e9364e3163550bd3610ac4336452c3bd04130233b63331ab9b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 55,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I love you like a brother, but I want an English cabman, who will be funny and ask me what his fare ‘is.’",
      "output_sha256": "ebab2755afa234fb1f37fbcac100a01959ac8b47f069718df4ce4efdf298742c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 56,
      "source_human_sha256": "ebab2755afa234fb1f37fbcac100a01959ac8b47f069718df4ce4efdf298742c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 56,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Your bugle calls stir my emotions, yet I find myself longing to see a London policeman.",
      "output_sha256": "4f1a48948d7d48660276f59b6907758da982fd265f4b523e614f3889bbbf3da8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": 0.577525,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        57
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ef6cb3cc128fd58044d7ac45f11eb5b565f2965380e587d24bd29e1a35d790ee"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 56,
      "source_ai_sha256": "4f1a48948d7d48660276f59b6907758da982fd265f4b523e614f3889bbbf3da8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        56
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 57,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Take, oh, take me to see a London policeman.”",
      "output_sha256": "62ee882cbd8dd4202196d3e6a4bcb5921a2b9c711c7ed6a79066d2982496d130",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 58,
      "source_human_sha256": "62ee882cbd8dd4202196d3e6a4bcb5921a2b9c711c7ed6a79066d2982496d130",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 58,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The driver stood silently, his silhouette dark against the backdrop of the setting sun, and I was unable to discern whether he comprehended my sentiments.",
      "output_sha256": "373c809df6638113064fb7314063178e7fa3f81ef30ba3c034fa4edf42c2bf85",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
      "alignment_score": 0.424632,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        59
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "9a1570ed3bdf9e2c786d3bce99b6561cba50acab741092be36b04e59a2d97b92"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 58,
      "source_ai_sha256": "373c809df6638113064fb7314063178e7fa3f81ef30ba3c034fa4edf42c2bf85",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        58
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 59,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I got back into his carriage.",
      "output_sha256": "95c24a69fd78322588499b7b54824f6e0696ca90d783513d033c82a618a99ab7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 60,
      "source_human_sha256": "95c24a69fd78322588499b7b54824f6e0696ca90d783513d033c82a618a99ab7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 60,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“You will understand,” I said, “if ever you are an exile even for pleasure.",
      "output_sha256": "d103fbd3aa925ec930881919ef89ed50814223ba30b7a764e0630b4c87f1df23",
      "alignment_unit_index": 54,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 61,
      "source_human_sha256": "d103fbd3aa925ec930881919ef89ed50814223ba30b7a764e0630b4c87f1df23",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 61,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The yearning of a child for its mother, the longing of a man for his homeland, as a fellow countryman of yours once expressed.",
      "output_sha256": "e084ee2b248ef9676076953e7148e2e97ef225440a4584f290b30057a9d4888c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 55,
      "alignment_score": 0.593543,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        62
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ac25a93cb0890bd5fd3dec8bf7384fc3d4c9f128b6c8676ab864bc9b3dc8b64f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 61,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e084ee2b248ef9676076953e7148e2e97ef225440a4584f290b30057a9d4888c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        61
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 62,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "However, as it seems a rather lengthy journey to the English end of the world, we might as well return to Besançon.\"",
      "output_sha256": "d03f9c3509e676f1ee5dc4b2b8bf38fc7b426636aebcd0aa1171c86debec606e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 56,
      "alignment_score": 0.555489,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        63
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b06f69409bb212b08cdff8574f95ca5b65cca8a76394f6551d27884de5a700dc"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 62,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d03f9c3509e676f1ee5dc4b2b8bf38fc7b426636aebcd0aa1171c86debec606e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        62
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 63,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Only as the stars came out among those immortal hills I wept for Walham Green.",
      "output_sha256": "b630a119685ecaf95c7ec133a692d82b0ddae7213f5565738f44ff39e72e88c9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 57,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 64,
      "source_human_sha256": "b630a119685ecaf95c7ec133a692d82b0ddae7213f5565738f44ff39e72e88c9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    }
  ]
}
